  ✓ Implement solution.py and generate solution.mpy
  ✓ Create verification.k and spec.k
  ✓ Compile and exercise concrete execution with krun
  ✓ Run and iterate symbolic proofs with kprove
  → Finalize prove.sh and validate all deliverables
